  right when he builds a ship  and heads out in search of the blessed  realm eventually  elwyn joins him together they reached  the blessed realm and asked the valor to  return to middle earth and help their  relatives who were on the brink of  destruction  the guardians moved by personal  sacrifice forgive the elves  and respond to the call once the valor  receive arendelle's plea for aid  they gather a massive army and head to  middle-earth to face down morguth once  and for all  morgoth has grown even more powerful and  unlike his lieutenant sauron  doesn't need a magic ring to inflict his  will known as the war of wrath  the conflict that ensues makes the  battle of the five armies look like a  bar room brawl  elves men gods eagles dragons  balrogs and orcs enter the fray in an  all-out battle of good versus evil  morgoth's armies are powerful but  ultimately they can't overcome the host  from the blessed realm  facing a defeat is total as sauron's  future fall morgoth is dethroned and his  army's vanquished  however the fight is so intense that it  breaks the land causing a flood  as water rushes in the region is  completely submerged  this event creates the familiar map of  middle earth we know from the lord of  the rings  with the land sinking beneath their feet  most of the elves and valor  head back to the blessed realm however  many others  both good and evil choose to head east  here the first age ends and the second  age begins  and with it comes a new threat in the  form of margot's second in command  sauron who will prove to be an even more  powerful foe  check out one of our newest videos right  here plus even more looper videos about  the lord of the rings are coming soon  subscribe to our youtube channel and hit  the bell so you don't miss a single one

